Conclusions
This
study
provides
important
findings
on
the
early
outbreak
of
COVID-19
in
Europe
.
Due
to
the
recent
rapid
increase
in
new
cases
of
COVID-19
,
real-time
monitoring
of
the
transmissibility
and
mortality
in
Spain
and
France
is
a
priority
.
